{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_08_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_08","title":"渗透作战","storyCode":"OD-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"a9ba283ba3a8a3527da1772fb7bacf24de0f7bb2c5c4cb2ea74d3d39dfb4b03f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在激烈的战斗后，列维与他的造物长埋于长泉镇地底，而负责防守领主宅邸的干员也获得了意料之外的增援。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lab"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的球形生物崩裂分解，变成了散落一地的蠕动块状物，这些奇诡的活物还在扭动翻腾，它们拒绝着死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"这东西还在动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"炸弹部署完了，我们得撤了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"它......好像在重生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这东西......到底算什么生物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不管它是什么，这东西都不应该存在于这个世界上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得撤了，要赶在炸弹爆炸之前跑出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"走这边！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我没子弹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"巡林者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我还在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"你的情况看起来可不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老了，老了......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才没躲开，小问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"现在怎么办？要去避难所吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"矿洞那边，还没消息吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫也没想到我们能坚持这么久......不过也快到极限了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你在干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"弄一面盾牌，我其实早想这么试试了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"这就像是回到了过去，那些有关荣耀的美好时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻的巡林者们集结在镇子的入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"明知道大军压境，明知道在战争之后他们中很多人都会血洒这片荒地之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他们有说有笑，高呼着战歌，仿佛敌人是不堪一击的虫豸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"战争残忍无情，有人退缩了，更多人决定死守到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"倒下的人成为了传奇，站着的人负责铭记他们的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"最后站着的那个人，也慢慢开始畏惧死亡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他不想忘记那些倒下的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......也许是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"很荣幸和你并肩作战，亚历山大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我也很荣幸，巡林者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"不要这么悲观，我还没有放弃战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是用砸的，也要敲死几个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......那是什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"箭矢\n箭矢如同暴雨一样落在了宅邸门口的土地上，精准地击穿了畸变体的头骨与喉咙。\n由锋锐飞矢编织成的暴雨没有分毫停歇，就像是风暴席卷了大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"是援军！哈哈哈哈哈哈！我们得救了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"这个手法......是那个年轻人吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"我收到了求救信号，本来以为只是一次普通的救援任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有想到会在这里遇到你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"老游侠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"你重操旧业了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，老了老了，让你看笑话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"你的弯刀呢，游侠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"年纪大了，早就耍不动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"若不是你来，今天我这把老骨头怕是要交代在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"你谦虚了，老游侠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"小队注意，目标在领主宅邸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人是危险的变异源石生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"随时汇报位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"当心点，它们数量很多，让你的人尽量避免落单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，注意地下，它们会钻洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"很荣幸与你并肩战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"“血色山谷的弯刀”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["灰烬"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["闪击"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["战车"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
